1H), 5.51-5.57 (m, 1H), 5.79-5.89 (m, 2H); 13C NMR (126 MHz,CDCl3) δ 13.5
(d, JP,C = 1.8 Hz), 15.5, 21.2, 22.1, 22.2, 22.8, 25.5, 27.4 (d, JP,C =
6.4 Hz), 31.6, 34.2, 38.4 (d, JP,C = 5.5 Hz), 43.2, 45.1 (d, JP,C = 127.2
Hz), 49.0 (d, JP,C = 5.5 Hz), 74.9 (d, JP,C = 7.3 Hz), 122.8 (d, JP,C =
