Hz), 15.8, 21.2, 22.2, 22.7, 24.6, 28.4 (d, JP,C = 7.3 Hz), 31.5, 34.1,
39.3 (d, JP,C = 3.6 Hz), 42.9, 43.9 (d, JP,C = 129.9 Hz), 49.1 (d, JP,C =
5.5 Hz), 75.0 (d, JP,C = 8.2 Hz), 123.8 (d, JP,C = 9.1 Hz), 126.4 (d,
